<!--
  No `package` attribute: Android Gradle Plugin 8 removed it outright and fails
  the build if it is present. The package comes from `namespace` in
  build.gradle.kts instead.

  Deliberately empty otherwise, and that is worth stating rather than leaving to
  be noticed. The other native libraries here declare permissions and a
  transparent Activity to host a system prompt; showing a dialog needs neither,
  because neither platform gates it. Nothing from this library appears in the
  host app's merged manifest, on its Play Store listing, or in its data safety
  form.
-->
<manifest xmlns:android="http://schemas.android.com/apk/res/android" />
